{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57191","headline":"十二时颂 十一 · 宝志","name":"十二时颂 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜半子，心住无生即生死。\n生死何曾属有无，用时便用没文字。\n祖师言，外边事，识取起时还不是。\n作意搜求实没踪，生死魔来任相试。\n（《宗镜录》卷二九引末五句，「识取起时」作「取着元来」，「没」作「勿」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}